<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Doyle Hotels appoints new sales/marketing head.</title>
<headline>Doyle Hotels appoints new sales/marketing head.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Doyle Hotel Group said on Thursday it had appointed Mike Glancy as its new Sales and Marketing Manager with effect from May this year.</p>
<p>A company statement said Glancy would be responsible for the marketing of the 10 hotels in the Doyle Group in Ireland and internationally.</p>
<p>Glancy joins the Doyle Group from Stakis plc, the Scttish-based hotel and leisure group.</p>
<p>Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
